{
  "bookId": "rewind-21",
  "id": "chapter-87",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23000001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "——当当当！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "有什么东西被敲击的声音响起，节奏越来越快。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "咕哇！该起床了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "紫苑，还是朱菜？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "才不是，是米莉姆哒！叫你起床啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000006",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "米莉姆 · 魔王日常\n商品名称：米莉姆·纳瓦 Ver.  \n作品名称：《蘑菇少女的日常》\n制造商：SNOW.A 细雪庭\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约224mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "喂喂，不要把我抱起来呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000008",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "利姆鲁 · 八星魔王之一\n商品名称：利姆鲁·特恩佩斯特 Ver.\n作品名称：《蘑菇少女的日常》\n制造商：LET'S RED 猩潮\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约224mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "探险，该去探险了！那个奇怪的人类已经走掉了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "那个手办设计师已经离开了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "真神奇，没想到会在这个世界变成手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "什么东西看起来都特别大。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "哈，变小的话也是有好处的不是吗，一人份的蜂蜜，也可以吃很久了吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "该说不愧是米莉姆吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "是吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "这个可不是夸奖哦……不过，算了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "所以，今天要去哪里探险呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "我们还是快点寻找如何回到特恩佩斯特的方法吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "好吧。顺便也看看这里有什么有趣的东西！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "先找怎么回去的方法！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "反正一时半会也不一定能找到，先了解这个世界的情报也很重要。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23000023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "那就这么说定了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-502",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "shilaimu",
