      ],
      "title": "命运交互·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23001001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "噢！噢~这里也很大呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "不知道今天能不能找到可以吃的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "运气好的话，说不定。不过变成了这副模样，你还能不能吃东西也不好说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "所以说，利姆鲁果然是太狡猾了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "因为是史莱姆，就算变成这副模样也还可以吞噬其他的东西！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "等一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "才不……嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "看到了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "奇怪的家伙，之前没见过他吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "看来也是会动的手办呢。不过这副鬼鬼祟祟的样子，不像是要做什么好事的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "他在做不好的事情，去教训他吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "顺便可以多拷问下这个世界的情报。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "……我们只是跟过去看看。现在外面的情况还是未知，不能惹出太多的麻烦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "唔，好吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "喔！这里竟然还有这样的房间吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "他是在偷东西！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "这家伙是有备而来的，那容器也是早就准备好，专门为了这些……涂料来的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "也就是说，那些涂料对于手办来说算是可以利用的东西？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "要抓住他吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "咦？不对！那家伙怎么突然跑掉了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23001021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "是发现我们了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-503",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "shilaimu",
          "rowIds": [
            23001001,
            23001002,
            23001003,
            23001004,
            23001005,
            23001006,
            23001007,
