      ],
      "title": "命运交互·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23004001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "可恶……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不对，停手吧，哈莉。他们不像是涂料小偷。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江，可是刚才……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "如果涂料小偷有这样的战斗力，先前也没必要躲躲藏藏了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "而且你看这个家伙的态度……根本也不是会想到要隐藏的那种吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "你们说的涂料小偷是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "一听就知道是不好的称呼，我竟然被当成了小偷？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "果然还是要给你们……唔！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "米莉姆，回来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "发生什么事了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "涂料小偷不见了，不过我们发现了两个没见过的手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这个是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "利姆鲁和米莉姆！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "奇怪的人类！竟然能和我们对话，而且还知道米莉姆大人的名字？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "既然我们是作为手办被制造出来的，他能知道这些信息也是理所当然的事情吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "初次见面，我是|101|。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "早就听说这次细雪庭和猩潮两位知名设计师亲手制作了你们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我还以为要半个月后才能见到，没想到这次运气这么好提前碰上了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过你们原本不该在这里的吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23004021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "可恶……偷跑竟然被发现了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-505",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "shilaimu",
          "rowIds": [
            23004001,
            23004002,
            23004003,
            23004004,
            23004005,
            23004006,
            23004007,
